<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Brooktrout cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Brooktrout cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>FAC Equities said it downgraded Brooktrout Technology Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- After the market closed on Monday, Brooktrout said it will not meet analysts' earnings or revenue expectations during the second quarter.</p>
<p>-- FAC Equities said it is unable to determine the drop in sales to fax service providers is due to weak demand or a loss in market share to a competitor.</p>
<p>-- said does anticipate much upside to the share price in the near-to-medium term.</p>
<p>-- Brooktrout lost 2-1/8 to 9-3/4 in afternoon trading.</p>
</text>
